From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: AztecBot <tech@aztec-labs.com>
Date: Fri, 25 Sep 2026 15:45:12 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(blob-lib): bind checkpoint boundaries into the blob
 commitments hash

Each step of the epoch's blob commitments hash now carries a flag marking the
first blob of each checkpoint, matching the rollup circuits and L1 BlobLib, so
the hash commits to how the epoch's blobs are split into checkpoints.

